<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex">
  <title>Page introuvable | Pandora Business Technology & Marketing</title>
  <link rel="shortcut icon" href="/assets/img/logo/cropped-LogoPB512gold-1.webp" type="image/webp">
  <style>
    :root { color-scheme: dark; }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0; min-height: 100vh; display: grid; place-items: center; padding: 24px;
      background: #0e0e0e; color: #e6c373;
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif; text-align: center;
    }
    main { max-width: 520px; }
    img { width: 96px; height: 96px; }
    .code { font-size: clamp(64px, 18vw, 120px); font-weight: 700; color: #d4af37; margin: 8px 0 0; line-height: 1; }
    h1 { font-size: 22px; margin: 16px 0 8px; color: #f3e2b3; }
    p { margin: 0 0 6px; color: #b9a678; line-height: 1.5; }
    a.home {
      display: inline-block; margin-top: 24px; padding: 12px 28px; border-radius: 999px;
      background: #d4af37; color: #0e0e0e; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none;
    }
    a.home:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #f3e2b3; outline-offset: 3px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main>
    <img src="/assets/img/logo/cropped-LogoPB512gold-1.webp" alt="Pandora">
    <p class="code">404</p>
    <h1>Page introuvable</h1>
    <p>La page que vous cherchez n'existe pas ou a été déplacée.</p>
    <p lang="en">The page you are looking for does not exist or has moved.</p>
    <a class="home" href="/">Retour à l'accueil · Back to home</a>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
